    "description": "<p>A speardancer who adopts the Northern posture is as beautiful and graceful in moments of stillness as her Southern compatriots are in thrashing revel. With a cold, reptilian economy of energy, the Northern-posture speardancer cuts through the wasteful excess of her enemy's defenses. When the Exalt invokes this Charm, her target suffers a DV penalty equal to the martial artist's Essence against the martial artist's attack. Other attacks that happen to occur on that same tick are unaffected.</p>",
